.TH LZAV 1 "September 2026" "lzav 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lzav \- fast lossless data compression utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lzav
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILES...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lzav
is a lightweight, extremely fast lossless data compression and decompression utility based on Aleksey Vaneev's LZAV algorithm.
It offers compression ratios superior to LZ4 and Snappy with decompression throughput reaching several gigabytes per second.
.PP
If no files are specified or if '-' is given,
.B lzav
reads from standard input and writes to standard output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-stdout
Write output on standard output, keep original files unchanged.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-decompress ", " \-\-decode
Decompress input files.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-test
Test the integrity of compressed files without writing decompressed data.
.TP
.BI \-i " file" ", " \-\-input= "file"
Specify input file explicitly.
.TP
.BI \-o " file" ", " \-\-output= "file"
Specify output file explicitly.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-force
Force overwrite of output files without prompt.
.TP
.BR \-k ", " \-\-keep
Keep input files (default behavior).
.TP
.BR \-1 ", " \-\-fast
Use fast compression mode (default, lzav_compress_default).
.TP
.BR \-2 ", " \-9 ", " \-\-best ", " \-\-hi
Use high compression mode (lzav_compress_hi) for better ratio.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Verbose mode; display compression ratios and block details.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage help and exit.
.SH AUTHOR
LZAV algorithm by Aleksey Vaneev.
CLI utility and packaging by seb3773 for TdeZip / Trinity Desktop Environment (TDE).
